# What must NOT be uploaded to a public host.
#
# Everything in the deployed folder is served as a static file. The index
# gate (`npm run check`) guards what the ASSISTANT can say; this guards
# what a stranger can simply download. They are different boundaries, and
# missing this one publishes the source documents whole.

# The knowledge base and, critically, knowledge/_private/ — the internal
# work-memory documents that name every client brand and describe their
# websites' defects. The serverless function does not need them: it reads
# data/index.json, which is built from them and carries no client names.
knowledge/

# Dev and build scripts. Nothing at runtime calls them.
tools/

# Keys. Vercel injects real environment variables; these are local only.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Local scratch
.cv-profile/
node_modules/
